      55.15,
      404.17,
      547.23,
      451.24
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies,Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specifiedhereinafter to submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for thesaid Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.75,
      464.17,
      547.2,
      487.24
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panelof a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      92.95,
      500.17,
      547.23,
      535.24
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Headof a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particular MediationBoard area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.95,
      548.17,
      521.41,
      559.24
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      86.95,
      572.17,
      520.21,
      583.24
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      88.75,
      596.17,
      244.75,
      607.24
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.15,
      620.17,
      547.07,
      643.24
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submit nominationsfor appointment to the Panel of Mediators of any Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      92.95,
      656.17,
      547.19,
      679.24
    ],
    "text": "(i) Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five years andwhich is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.75,
      692.17,
      406.22,
      715.24
    ],
    "text": "(a) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement ofthe community.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.15,
      728.17,
      340.78,
      739.24
    ],
    "text": "(b) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.29,
      71.17,
      537.81,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'02'27PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.02.20193A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      103.33,
      301.07,
      114.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) The enhancement of rural or community development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      127.33,
      234.45,
      138.4
    ],
    "text": "(d) The enhancement of culture of sports.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      151.33,
      539.9,
      174.4
    ],
    "text": "(e) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplying basic needs of thepeoples such as health, food and shelter etc.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      187.33,
      539.9,
      210.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment tothe Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.65,
      223.33,
      518.22,
      234.4
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretaries of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.65,
      247.33,
      539.86,
      270.4
    ],
    "text": "(ii) As the Following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Areawhose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      60.45,
      283.33,
      449.91,
      294.4
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person being a resident in Mediation Board Area and engaged in any work in that Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      307.33,
      539.84,
      330.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) Any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board Area, However the Commission is ofthe opinion that such particular person is eligible in exceptional circumstances; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      343.33,
      539.78,
      378.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) Any Public Officer nominated under this paragraph by the District Secretary of the Administrative District withinwhich that Mediation Board is situated is eligible for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of every MediationBoard area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      391.33,
      539.88,
      414.4
    ],
    "text": "(d) The present Chairman, Mediators of Panels of Mediators who are due to vacate post upon the completion of threeyears.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      427.33,
      539.92,
      450.4
    ],
    "text": "(e) Fulfilling of Minimum requirement as G.C.E. (O/L) is being compulsory for the new nominees other than themembers those who holding membership of Mediation Boards already.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.65,
      463.33,
      539.94,
      486.4
    ],
    "text": "(f) The minimum age limit of those are to forward nominators afresh should be more than 35 years of age save andexcept the members presently engage in duties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      499.33,
      539.92,
      522.4
    ],
    "text": "(g) Nominations of those who are engaged in duties in the field of banking, leasing, micro financing and insuranceinvolving in financial activities both in the government/semi government or private sector will not be considered.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.65,
      535.33,
      539.92,
      570.4
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph (02) above may submitnominations of such Public Officers as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above. An individual may notnominate his or her name for nominations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      583.33,
      539.87,
      606.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of Public Officers, of whomnot more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      65.85,
      619.33,
      176.86,
      630.4
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      643.33,
      391.16,
      654.4
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nominations substantially in Form (a) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      87.81,
      667.33,
      531.38,
      678.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      691.33,
      530.94,
      702.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      65.85,
      715.33,
      539.89,
      738.4
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate form and should without fail contain the recommendation of the nominatoras indicated in the next paragraph.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
